00:59:31,764 --> 00:59:37,764
Stockholm (known as The Captor in some countries) is a 2018 crime
comedy-drama film written, produced and directed by Robert Budreau.

12
01:04:56,470 --> 01:05:02,470
It stars Ethan Hawke, Noomi Rapace, Mark Strong, Christopher
Heyerdahl, Bea Santos and Thorbjørn Harr.

13
